While exploring, I discovered a gnome that had apparently
been created on top of a secret door.  After I killed it,
all its stuff disappeared.  When I searched and found the secret
door, the stuff reappeared.  This door happened to be locked
as well.  Kicking the door removed items from the stack, overwriting
my '@', until some rocks came to the top of the pile.  I hurt my
foot kicking these instead of getting them out of the pile.  I
finally opened the door with a pick axe and was then able to pick
up the stuff normally.  I haven't tried to figure out what is going
on yet, but I expect it will be fixed.

